# Mirror Gallery: "The 'legend rule' doesn't apply." Clone copying Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer is a legendary Ragavan too (CR
# 707.2, 205.4), and with both under Bot1 the legend rule (CR 704.5j) would have Bot1 keep one - but Mirror Gallery turns
# that state-based action off: Bot1 is asked nothing (the refusal "! Bot1.Choose" holds after the Clone resolves) and both
# Ragavans stay. clone-copying-your-own-legend-meets-the-legend-rule is the control, where the same Clone without the
# Gallery puts a Ragavan into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Mirror Gallery
Clone
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

